@anon.3c5d4856225436a016f648d8ca8332b3.2808 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [439 x i8] }> <{ [439 x i8] c"# `more_qualified_paths`\0A\0AThe `more_qualified_paths` feature can be used in order to enable the\0Ause of qualified paths in patterns.\0A\0A## Example\0A\0A```rust\0A#![feature(more_qualified_paths)]\0A\0Afn main() {\0A    // destructure through a qualified path\0A    let <Foo as A>::Assoc { br } = StructStruct { br: 2 };\0A}\0A\0Astruct StructStruct {\0A    br: i8,\0A}\0A\0Astruct Foo;\0A\0Atrait A {\0A    type Assoc;\0A}\0A\0Aimpl A for Foo {\0A    type Assoc = StructStruct;\0A}\0A```\0A" }>, align 1
